  "headline": "FDA's shortage list shows Pfizer Inc. azithromycin tablets to be discontinued as of 2026-04-09; the shortage has been posted for 56 months as of 2026-10-21",
  "headline_cites": ["E8", "D7"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list records Pfizer Inc. azithromycin tablets as To Be Discontinued with an initial posting date of 2026-04-09.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 56 months.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 347 units at 31.2 units per day, providing 11 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 702 units at 31.7 units per day, providing 22 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The label for NDC 71205067403 names Proficient Rx LP as the product labeler and plant, with operations of RELABEL and REPACK and a last inspection classification of VAI on 2022-12-08.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1194148 of Proficient Rx LP ended 2022-12-08 and was classified VAI; the classification letter was issued 2023-02-08, 289 days after the shortage posting on 2022-02-22.",
      "cites": ["D3", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from A-S Medication Solutions, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
